      "id": "claim_2e534a5c2f204e5c946d7bbcfbcb1f86",
      "statement": "bron_referentie is the source-native identifier per record sitting in two unique btree indexes (source_record and aanvraag). boundBronReferentie keeps a value under BRON_REFERENTIE_MAX_LENGTH (2000) UTF-8 bytes unchanged; when it exceeds the cap it replaces the value with a sha256-prefixed digest of the whole value rather than truncating, because truncation would silently merge two records that differ only past the cut.",
